stream
BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 755.00 Tm (THE BIG MONEY PLAYBOOKS) Tj ET
0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Action: Run synthetic retention tests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Detail: Record findings and retest after configuration changes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 678.55 Tm (Separate zero training, zero provider retention, and zero application retention in every answer. They are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm (different commitments. For OpenAI, verify whether the organization has approved Zero Data Retention) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (controls and whether the chosen endpoint and features qualify. For Anthropic, verify contractual retention) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (arrangements and feature coverage rather than treating ordinary commercial API access as automatically) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (ZDR. For AWS Bedrock and GCP Vertex, inspect the exact managed service, model publisher, region,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (abuse-monitoring terms, and customer-controlled logging settings. Marketplace models and optional tools) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (may introduce different conditions. Do not transplant a direct provider agreement onto a cloud reseller route.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (Store dated evidence of the account settings and governing terms. Where a setting cannot be inspected) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (directly, obtain written confirmation identifying the account and service rather than relying on a generic sales) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (statement.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (Configure the product around an allowlist of verified routes, with separate credentials and project boundaries) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (where practical. Reject unsupported attachments, persistent assistants, caching modes, or tool integrations) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (on workloads sold as ZDR unless their retention behavior is documented and compatible. Disable optional) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (payload logging and tracing; redact before records enter monitoring systems rather than scheduling deletion) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (after ingestion. Examine queues, retry stores, dead-letter queues, embeddings, uploaded files, and support) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (exports. Provider ZDR does not erase your database or an engineer's debug capture. Keep operational) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (metadata only where justified, with defined fields and expiry. On provider failure, return a clear retryable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (error or use another verified route; never silently send a protected workload to an ordinary fallback. Track) Tj ET
